@ref Dieu 4 (src:138-140; src:145-158; src:161-166)
DECLARE `An enterprise` HAS
    `established, organised and operating under this Law and other related laws` IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on reinsurance business and ceding`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates to carry on insurance brokerage activity`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on life insurance`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on non-life insurance`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `carries on health insurance`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a legal person`                                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a dependent unit of a foreign insurer or reinsurer`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign insurer or reinsurer guarantees and answers for all its obligations in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
    `keeps independent accounts`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `was founded by members or a body representing members`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `operates without a profit purpose, for mutual support among members`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `is voluntary, financially autonomous and answerable only within the assets formed from microinsurance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign body is a non-life insurer`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the foreign body is a reinsurer`                                            IS A BOOLEAN

