DECLARE `A role in a contract` HAS
    `concluded the contract of insurance with an insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pays the insurance premium`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `has property, civil liability, health, life, an obligation or an economic interest insured under the contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `was designated by the policyholder or the insured person to receive the insurance money as the contract agrees` IS A BOOLEAN

