@ref Dieu 4 (src:132-137; src:186-190)
DECLARE `A contract arrangement` HAS
    `is an agreement between the policyholder and the insurer, branch or mutual organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the policyholder must pay premium under it`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer, branch or mutual organisation must compensate or pay as agreed under it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `several insurers or branches of foreign non-life insurers agreed to make it with the policyholder in one contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they take premium and compensate or pay in the ratio agreed in the contract` IS A BOOLEAN

