DECLARE `An act in insurance business` HAS
    `is insurance, reinsurance, ceding or brokerage business`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done without a licence to establish and operate`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done outside the scope of the licence`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is insurance agency activity`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `is an ancillary insurance service`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor does not meet the conditions of law to do it`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `is colluding with a beneficiary to settle a claim unlawfully` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is forging documents or deliberately falsifying information in a claim dossier` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is forging documents or deliberately falsifying information to refuse a claim after the insured event` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is causing loss to one's own property or health to get insurance benefits` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is threatening or coercing the making of an insurance contract` IS A BOOLEAN

