DECLARE `A portfolio transfer` HAS
    `the Ministry of Finance required it under Dieu 113(8)(c) or (d)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it narrows the content or scope of activity`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `it follows a division, split, merger, consolidation, dissolution or cessation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it follows a revocation under Dieu 75(1)(a), (d) or (e)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer is already carrying on the line transferred` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer meets the capital adequacy ratio and solvency requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the receiving insurer meets the conditions to run the line after receipt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `value of the assets transferred`                        IS A NUMBER
    `technical reserve of the whole portfolio transferred`   IS A NUMBER
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the Ministry of Finance approved`                  IS A DATE
    `date the transferor published and notified the policyholders` IS A DATE

§§ `Chuong III, Muc 6: capital, deposit, reserves, investment, separation of sources, audit, reports`

