DECLARE `The capital of an insurer` HAS
    `charter capital paid up`                                IS A NUMBER
    `capital allocated to a foreign branch`                  IS A NUMBER
    `reserve funds`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `undistributed after-tax profit`                         IS A NUMBER
    `funds of the owner set aside from after-tax profit`     IS A NUMBER
    `other sources the Ministry of Finance allows to be recognised`  IS A NUMBER
    `amounts the Ministry of Finance requires to be deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `amount invested in other insurers, other reinsurers and subsidiaries of insurers and reinsurers` IS A NUMBER
    `risk-based capital`                                     IS A NUMBER

