DECLARE `A technical reserve` HAS
    `set aside separately for each line of insurance`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `computed and set aside using the actuary`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` IS A BOOLEAN

