DECLARE `A separation of sources` HAS
    `kind of insurer`                                        IS A `A kind of insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a participating life contract portfolio`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS A BOOLEAN
    `follows the registered or notified principles`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS A BOOLEAN

