DECLARE `A supervisory measure` HAS
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires early intervention` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the capital adequacy ratio is at the level that requires control` IS A BOOLEAN
    `improvement measures were applied for 12 continuous months without restoring the ratio` IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the Ministry of Finance's order`                IS A DATE
    `date the insurer built and reported its remedial plan`  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the insurer hired an independent auditor`          IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the ratio was restored`                            IS A MAYBE DATE
    `the restoration was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a control measure has been applied`                     IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An activity during a supervisory measure` HAS
    `transfers profit abroad, distributes profit or pays dividends` IS A BOOLEAN
    `takes on more reinsurance`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `buys back its own shares`                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `widens the content, scope or term of activity`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `contributes capital to found an enterprise, or buys real estate other than for its own premises or storage serving its operations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `invests in high-risk assets or does business that lowers the ratio` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Dieu 115: dissolution of an insurer, ending of a foreign branch.
-- src:2483 | Điều 115. Giải thể doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm, doanh nghiệp tái bảo hiểm,
