DECLARE `A licence application` HAS
    `charter capital is contributed in Vietnamese dong`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `charter capital`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `minimum charter capital the Government sets`            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `founders use borrowed capital or funds entrusted by others` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has an organisational form this Law provides`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a draft charter consistent with the Law on Enterprises` IS A BOOLEAN

