DECLARE `An office in an insurer` IS ONE OF
    `chair of the board or of the members' council`
    `member of the board or of the members' council`
    `chief executive or legal representative`
    `another manager`
    `head of a business department`
    `a controller`

DECLARE `A candidate officer` HAS
    `holds the right to manage enterprises under the Law on Enterprises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has no administrative penalty in insurance`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `was not dismissed for breaching internal procedures in the 3 continuous years before the appointment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is not prosecuted at the time of election or appointment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a university degree or higher`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in insurance`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in economics, finance, banking, law, business administration, accounting or auditing that includes an insurance subject` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in another field that includes an insurance subject` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate from a lawful training body in Vietnam or abroad` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on` IS A BOOLEAN
    `years working directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS A NUMBER
    `years as a manager, executive or controller of an enterprise or organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking` IS A NUMBER
    `years as a manager or controller of an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch` IS A NUMBER
    `years of experience in insurance, finance, banking or the intended specialty` IS A NUMBER
    `years of experience in insurance or the intended specialty` IS A NUMBER
    `resides in Vietnam while in office`                     IS A BOOLEAN

