@ref Dieu 55 (src:1050-1064)
DECLARE `A safety measure` HAS
    `the insured person failed to take the safety measures` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer fixed a time for taking them`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the time has expired and they are still not taken`     IS A BOOLEAN

