DECLARE `A liability contract and a claim` HAS
    `a third person claimed compensation from the insured person`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act causing the damage occurred within the insurance term` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the third person's claim was made within the insurance term` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the third person claims directly from the insurer`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the law provides that the third person may claim directly`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount the insured person must pay the third person by law`   IS A NUMBER
    `costs of resolving the dispute on liability to the third person` IS A NUMBER
    `interest payable to the third person for the insured person's late payment as the insurer directed` IS A NUMBER
    `limit of liability`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `the contract agrees otherwise on the limit`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person must post a bond or deposit to keep the property from detention or to avoid a suit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured person asks the insurer to give the bond or deposit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract so agrees`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer negotiates with the third person for the insured person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract agrees otherwise on representation`             IS A BOOLEAN
